# Preregistration Policy

All mechanisms run under **frozen prereg JSONs** (parameter locks, null structures, and target metrics).  
Each release publishes the prereg file and its **SHA-256**.  
Replications should report the prereg hash alongside their outputs.

mechanism: 14
run_date: 2025-10-09
model:
  alpha: 1
  beta: 6.283185307179586  # approx 2π
  gamma: 0.005
eft:
  mode: "Frozen_EFT_OptionB_v0.1"
  c_g: 0.0
  c_y: 0.0
kernel:
  type: "retarded_exponential"
  beta_kernel: 6.283185307179586
nulls:
  - type: "shuffle"
    n: 1000
metrics:
  primary: "fisher_combined_p"
inputs:
  traits_csv: "data/traits_10panel.csv"
outputs:
  outdir: "outputs/mech14/2025-10-09"
